    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Netcapital is undergoing a strategic pivot from a transaction-based fundraising portal to a full-service capital markets infrastructure platform, adding broker-dealer capabilities, analytics, advisory tools, and tokenization (with PureWave Hydrogen as a first client). The company aims to harness its proprietary dataset for an AI-driven revenue model. These plans signal expansion into higher-value services for growth companies. However, the narrative is shaped entirely by company press releases; external indicators of demand, competitive response, or market traction are absent.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Under newly appointed CEO Todd Violette, management is executing a bold transformation—shifting the business model, acquiring Iverson Design, and introducing tokenization services to diversify revenue. The team communicates proactively through business update calls and detailed strategic announcements. Yet, all progress reports are self-reported, without independent analyst commentary or market feedback, leaving the credibility of the execution and its scalability unverified in the public domain.",
